  "_comment": [
    "Place of the Stormcaller branch in the Class Skills tab of Skill Tree (RPG Series). Read on every load (/reload).",
    "Data packs may replace this file. Titles, texts, icons and rewards come from the own tab:",
    "stormcaller:puffish_skills/categories/stormcaller/definitions.json (nodes map to definitions like its skills.json).",
    "forms: the form whose root_radius is closest to the circle in the loaded data is used.",
    "  nodes: [along the branch axis from the root, to the side]; links: the connections of the branch.",
    "  place: the branch goes after the root with the definition 'after' (going clockwise), ideally right before 'before'.",
    "min_node_distance / min_line_distance: room between two branches (node centre to node centre / to a line).",
    "respace: all branches spread out evenly; if they get too close, all move outwards in shift_step steps up to max_shift.",
    "  The circle must be regular (radius and angle steps within the tolerances), otherwise gap is used.",
    "gap: the other branches stay, the Stormcaller root moves outwards in a gap up to max_root_radius."
